  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-33-92">色白の姉に具されて。今日もまた昔談や。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-92-145">あれいま。逍遙うんじて歸る山路。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-145-191">遠音に渡るかほととぎすの。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-191-223">つみとりてそぞろ心や</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 6em" rend="first-line-indent(6)"><seg source="#source-223-264">くちづけさはに</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-264-319">願ふは君が髮ぐさ飾るやさし七草。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-319-384">あかつきや破れし鐘樓に。肩ねびし人と登りぬ</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-384-434">見よ君。指ざす方に日は出らめ。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-434-486">ああかの野路こそいと戀ひしや。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-486-533">行きずりの小草の中に。床し小扇</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 6em" rend="first-line-indent(6)"><seg source="#source-533-574">誰がすさみぞや</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)">これ優しぐさ『秋の恨み』と。</p>
    </body>
